  "Solution": {
    "S": "Cisplatin has the chemical formula [Pt(NH₃)₂Cl₂]. In this compound, NH₃ (ammonia) is a neutral ligand and Cl⁻ (chloride) is an anionic ligand. Therefore, the ligands present are NH₃ and Cl⁻, which corresponds to option B."
